<!DOCTYPE html><html class="antialiased [font-feature-settings:&#x27;ss01&#x27;] scrollbar overflow-y-scroll" lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8" data-next-head=""/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" data-next-head=""/><title data-next-head="">Metaplex Core | Next-Gen NFT Standard for Solana</title><meta name="description" content="Metaplex Core is the next-generation NFT standard on Solana with single-account design, enforced royalties, and a flexible plugin system. Lower costs, lower compute, better performance." data-next-head=""/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.metaplex.com/docs/smart-contracts/core" data-next-head=""/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="en" href="https://www.metaplex.com/docs/smart-contracts/core" data-next-head=""/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="ja" href="https://www.metaplex.com/docs/ja/smart-contracts/core" data-next-head=""/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="ko" href="https://www.metaplex.com/docs/ko/smart-contracts/core" data-next-head=""/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="zh" href="https://www.metaplex.com/docs/zh/smart-contracts/core" data-next-head=""/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="x-default" href="https://www.metaplex.com/docs/smart-contracts/core" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:title" content="Metaplex Core | Next-Gen NFT Standard for Solana" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:description" content="Metaplex Core is the next-generation NFT standard on Solana with single-account design, enforced royalties, and a flexible plugin system. Lower costs, lower compute, better performance." data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:url" content="https://www.metaplex.com/docs/smart-contracts/core" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:type" content="website" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:image" content="https://www.metaplex.com/docs/api/og?title=Overview&amp;description=Metaplex+Core+is+the+next-generation+NFT+standard+on+Solana+with+single-account+design%2C+enforced+royalties%2C+and+a+flexible+plugin+system.+Lower+costs%2C+lower+compute%2C+better+performance.&amp;product=core" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:image:height" content="630" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:locale:alternate" content="ja_JP" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:locale:alternate" content="ko_KR" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:locale:alternate" content="zh_CN" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Metaplex Core | Next-Gen NFT Standard for Solana" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Metaplex Core is the next-generation NFT standard on Solana with single-account design, enforced royalties, and a flexible plugin system. Lower costs, lower compute, better performance." data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.metaplex.com/docs/api/og?title=Overview&amp;description=Metaplex+Core+is+the+next-generation+NFT+standard+on+Solana+with+single-account+design%2C+enforced+royalties%2C+and+a+flexible+plugin+system.+Lower+costs%2C+lower+compute%2C+better+performance.&amp;product=core" data-next-head=""/><meta property="twitter:domain" content="metaplex.com" data-next-head=""/><script type="application/ld+json" data-next-head="">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.metaplex.com/docs"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Smart Contracts","item":"https://www.metaplex.com/docs/smart-contracts"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Core","item":"https://www.metaplex.com/docs/smart-contracts/core"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"name":"Overview"}]}</script><script type="application/ld+json" data-next-head="">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"TechArticle","@id":"https://www.metaplex.com/docs/smart-contracts/core#article","headline":"Overview","url":"https://www.metaplex.com/docs/smart-contracts/core","inLanguage":"en","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.metaplex.com/docs/smart-contracts/core","url":"https://www.metaplex.com/docs/smart-contracts/core"},"author":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.metaplex.com/docs/#organization","name":"Metaplex","url":"https://www.metaplex.com/docs","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.metaplex.com/docs/metaplex-logo-white.png"}},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.metaplex.com/docs/#organization","name":"Metaplex","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.metaplex.com/docs/metaplex-logo-white.png"}},"audience":{"@type":"Audience","audienceType":"Developers"},"discussionUrl":"https://discord.gg/metaplex","description":"Metaplex Core is the next-generation NFT standard on Solana with single-account design, enforced royalties, and a flexible plugin system. Lower costs, lower compute, better performance.","dateModified":"2026-09-03","keywords":["Metaplex Core","Solana NFT","NFT standard","single-account NFT","enforced royalties","mpl-core"],"about":[{"@type":"Thing","name":"NFT standards"},{"@type":"Thing","name":"Solana blockchain"},{"@type":"Thing","name":"Digital assets"}],"proficiencyLevel":"Beginner","isPartOf":{"@type":"CreativeWork","@id":"https://www.metaplex.com/docs/smart-contracts/core#documentation","name":"Core Documentation","url":"https://www.metaplex.com/docs/smart-contracts/core"},"dependencies":"@metaplex-foundation/mpl-core, @metaplex-foundation/umi, mpl-core (Rust crate)","mentions":[{"@type":"SoftwareSourceCode","name":"@metaplex-foundation/mpl-core","codeRepository":"https://github.com/metaplex-foundation/mpl-core","programmingLanguage":{"@type":"ComputerLanguage","name":"TypeScript"}},{"@type":"SoftwareSourceCode","name":"@metaplex-foundation/umi","codeRepository":"https://github.com/metaplex-foundation/umi","programmingLanguage":{"@type":"ComputerLanguage","name":"TypeScript"}},{"@type":"SoftwareSourceCode","name":"mpl-core","codeRepository":"https://github.com/metaplex-foundation/mpl-core","programmingLanguage":{"@type":"ComputerLanguage","name":"Rust"}}]}</script><script type="application/ld+json" data-next-head="">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Metaplex Core?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Metaplex Core is a next-generation NFT standard on Solana that uses a single-account design for lower costs, enforced royalties, and a flexible plugin system. It's the recommended standard for new NFT projects."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is Core different from Token Metadata?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Core uses one account per asset vs 3+ for Token Metadata, costs ~80% less to mint, has lower compute usage, and includes built-in royalty enforcement."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I migrate from Token Metadata to Core?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Core Assets and Token Metadata NFTs are separate standards. There's no automatic migration. New projects should use Core; existing Token Metadata collections continue to work."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Core support royalties?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Core has a Royalties plugin that enforces royalties by default. You can set basis points, creator splits, and allowlist/denylist rules for marketplaces."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are plugins?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Plugins are modular extensions that add behavior to Core Assets or Collections. Examples include Freeze Delegate, Attributes, and Royalties."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does it cost to mint a Core Asset?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Approximately 0.003 SOL per base asset, compared to ~0.022 SOL for Token Metadata. This makes Core ~80% cheaper for minting."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which RPC providers support Core?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"All major RPC providers supporting DAS (Digital Asset Standard) index Core assets."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use Core for gaming assets?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Core's plugin system makes it ideal for gaming with Attributes for on-chain stats, Freeze Delegate for locking items, and Transfer Delegate for marketplace integration."}}]}</script><script>
