 Concepts</a></h3></li><li class="relative"><h3><a class="block w-full py-0.5 pl-3.5 before:pointer-events-none before:absolute before:-left-[2px] before:top-1/2 before:h-4 before:w-[3px] before:-translate-y-1/2 font-normal text-muted-foreground before:hidden before:bg-primary hover:text-foreground hover:before:block" href="/docs/en/smart-contracts/core#quick-reference">Quick Reference</a></h3></li><li class="relative"><h3><a class="block w-full py-0.5 pl-3.5 before:pointer-events-none before:absolute before:-left-[2px] before:top-1/2 before:h-4 before:w-[3px] before:-translate-y-1/2 font-normal text-muted-foreground before:hidden before:bg-primary hover:text-foreground hover:before:block" href="/docs/en/smart-contracts/core#next-steps">Next Steps</a></h3></li><li class="relative"><h3><a class="block w-full py-0.5 pl-3.5 before:pointer-events-none before:absolute before:-left-[2px] before:top-1/2 before:h-4 before:w-[3px] before:-translate-y-1/2 font-normal text-muted-foreground before:hidden before:bg-primary hover:text-foreground hover:before:block" href="/docs/en/smart-contracts/core#faq">FAQ</a></h3></li><li class="relative"><h3><a class="block w-full py-0.5 pl-3.5 before:pointer-events-none before:absolute before:-left-[2px] before:top-1/2 before:h-4 before:w-[3px] before:-translate-y-1/2 font-normal text-muted-foreground before:hidden before:bg-primary hover:text-foreground hover:before:block" href="/docs/en/smart-contracts/core#glossary">Glossary</a></h3></li></ol></nav></div></div><footer class="border-t border-border bg-background"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1"><a class="flex items-center gap-3" href="/docs"><img src="/docs/metaplex-logo-white.png" alt="Metaplex" class="h-4 w-auto no-lightense"/></a><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Metaplex Global Ltd.<br/>All rights reserve